OL,3,AWoman says she was left 'bewildered and
OL,4,Aconfused' by alleged Russell Brand
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand, 51, faces seven charges in the
OL,8,Ftrial - three counts of rape, three
OL,9,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,10,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
