OL,3,ANurse stole #750k from 99-year-old
OL,4,Awoman for cosmetic surgery and home
OL,5,Aimprovements
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Nursing and Midwifery Council (NMC)
OL,8,Fhearing found Burwood's fitness to
OL,9,Fpractise was impaired by reason of
OL,10,Fmisconduct and imposed a striking-off
OL,11,Forder, meaning she will be removed from
OL,12,Fthe nursing register.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
