OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas new US law takes effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes days after Trump said the US
OL,7,Fwould import Russian diesel in an
OL,8,Feffort to bring down US energy prices
OL,9,Fbefore the midterm elections in
OL,10,FNovember, which will decide which party
OL,11,Fcontrols Congress.
OL,13,FThe plan shocked lawmakers, and has
OL,14,Ftriggered a bipartisan backlash.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
